## `spec` fields

These are the top-level fields of the Campaign spec, the same as `spec:` in YAML. Nested objects are described in the
server's JSON Schema at `GET /v1/schemas` (also used by the UI builder for validation).

| Field | Type | | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `description` | string | optional |  |
| `workflow` | string | **required** |  |
| `targets` | object | **required** |  |
| `inputs` | map | optional | Workflow inputs (expressions over target). |
| `policy` | object | optional |  |

